er noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>LinkedIn </a></li><li><a href="https://wisskomm.social/@unibremen" title="Öffnet Link zu Mastodon in neuem Fenster" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-mastodon fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>Mastodon </a></li></ul></div><div class="col-12 mt-3 UBcopyright">&copy; Universität Bremen 2026</div></div></div></section></footer><button type="button" class="scroll down btn btn-link typo3-search-exclude"><span class="css-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="css-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sr-only pageDown">Zum Seitenende springen</span><span class="sr-only pageUp">Zum Seitenanfang springen</span></button></div> <script id="powermail_conditions_container" data-condition-uri="https://www.uni-bremen.de/powermail_cond"></script> <script src="/typo3temp/assets/compressed/merged-fc4857a2ed9548625e03ce26ccd430f9-min.js.gz?1770218651"></script> <script src="/_assets/8ec6f74154680cbbd6366024eea31e0b/JavaScript/MathJax-2.7.9/MathJax.js?config=TeX-MML-AM_CHTML&amp;1757503490" defer="defer"></script> <script src="/typo3temp/assets/compressed/b7publicmessage.min-min.js.gz?1770218651" defer="defer"></script> <script src="/typo3temp/assets/compressed/merged-3d946be5b779dbaded450fbdceb3748d-min.js.gz?1770218651"></script> <script src="/typo3temp/assets/compressed/Form.min-min.js.gz?1770218651" defer="defer"></script> <script src="/typo3temp/assets/compressed/PowermailCondition.min-min.js.gz?1770218651" defer="defer"></script> <script async="async" src="/typo3temp/assets/compressed/default_frontend-8b0e8cf99b173e687122ab25f25d91e8-min.js.gz?1770218651"></script> <script type="text/javascript">var siteId =1;</script> </body> </html>